      "text": " concerns or questions; how the family is doing and how siblings are adjusting; best and hardest times of day; whether the parent feels tired or blue; how feedings are going; time for the parents; who helps with the baby; wet diapers and stools; what they do to keep the baby safe; new medical problems in relatives."
